   "thinking": "I'm tallying the column sums for the grid, working through each column in turn to track the running totals toward 48% progress.\n\nI'm checking the column totals against the recall numbers to see which digits are undercounted and which are overcounted. Digits 9, 7, and 0 look low, while 5 and 1 look high, so I'm weighing small bias adjustments to each.\n\nI'm checking whether the 7 template needs its stem made more vertical, which would shift where its mass sits relative to the 5. Then I'm weighing a higher orientation weight, from 2.2 to 3.0, since it seems to help separate the 7's top bar and slanted stem from the 5, though the evidence for that is still unclear.\n\nI'm adding a note that the 8 template is weak, since 8s get read as 2s, and I'm treating that as a reasonable outcome for now.\n\n",
